      "description": "Initialize or resume lossless project History Session. Git projects on Node 22+ default to project-local SQLite hs_* records; legacy/nonstandard/file-mode projects use docs/history-session/ Markdown. Call once near conversation start with verbatim initial_user_input, then echo the returned session_key on later calls. Without a host/explicit session_key, the server mints a new hs_<uuid> handle (never a shared project-active record). expected_path may be a virtual read locator, not a physical file. Never invent keys. Returns bounded state (≤64 KiB). Disable with MCP_HISTORY_SESSION=0|false|off.",
      "schema": "text",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "project_root",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Project root; omit to use workspace resolution"
        },
        {
          "name": "workspace_root",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Alias of project_root"
        },
        {
          "name": "session_key",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Echo the server-minted handle from a previous bootstrap in this conversation. Omit only on the first call; omitting later opens a new archive instead of merging."
        },
        {
          "name": "title",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Archive title when creating a new session"
        },
        {
          "name": "initial_user_input",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Verbatim first user request for this conversation"
        },
        {
          "name": "history_dir",
          "type": "string",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Relative history directory; default docs/history-session"
        },
        {
          "name": "create_if_missing",
          "type": "boolean",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "Create archive when missing; default true"
        },
        {
          "name": "mode",
          "type": "resume | fresh",
          "required": false,
          "desc": "resume (default) reuses the archive for this session_key; fresh always creates a new archive"
        }
      ],
      "usage": "新对话开始时**先 bootstrap**（传真实 initial_user_input；无宿主 session 第一次省略 session_key 后保存返回值）；Git/Node22 项目默认使用本地 SQLite hs_*，旧版 docs/history-session/ 文件模式仍支持，返回路径可能是虚拟读取定位符；不要提交活跃历史数据库",
